-----------------

* OpenBSD fido(4): https://man.openbsd.org/fido.4
* OpenBSD libfido2 API: https://man.openbsd.org/fido_dev_open.3
* OpenBSD 8.0 changes (libfido2 1.17.0): https://www.openbsd.org/plus80.html
* OpenBSD cargo module: https://man.openbsd.org/cargo-module.5
* Token2 tag 0.2.0: https://github.com/token2/fido2-manage/tree/0.2.0
* Token2 libfido2 patch: https://github.com/token2/fido2-manage/blob/0.2.0/libfido2-token2.patch
* OpenBSD PC/SC port: security/pcsc-lite
* OpenBSD CCID port: security/ccid
